# D3-PO-005: Thermoplastic and thermoset under the same thermal cycle
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 thermoplastic 5g @ 20C
add v2 thermoset_resin 5g @ 20C
heat v1 1.3kJ
heat v2 1.3kJ
measure v1 thermometer
measure v2 thermometer
look v1
look v2
cool v1 1.3kJ
cool v2 1.3kJ
look v1
look v2
inspect
